.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0e99dead1f3176b6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b001690423c70305END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_WYR_InsightPuzzle_Hint1</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_InsightPuzzle_Hint1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_InsightPuzzle_Hint1\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ddc9f895-2055-4350-8552-93c705e6cca2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ddc9f895-2055-4350-8552-93c705e6cca2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ddc9f895-2055-4350-8552-93c705e6cca2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n      <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><i>The Five Year War</i>\n</p><p>by Torwyn Basse\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>The war was, in truth, nothing short of a tragedy. It began as a mild altercation between the sanguine sons of the Aelio and Vida families regarding (if you can believe it) the proper ownership of a sheep farm.  Over the course of three seasons, full-blown conflict had erupted between <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> and Victan. A pointless war, leaving both cities with nothing but a thousand youthful corpses to show for it.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214408\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1330/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24346/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6351/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931333/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.547      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.547      1 -total\n 51.45%   20.347      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.87%   18.141     15 Template:Trim\n 25.04%    9.904      2 Template:Uid\n 16.25%    6.425      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.32%    5.665      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.92%    3.922      1 Template:Books\n  9.86%    3.900      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.26%    3.661      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12839-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214408 and revision id 364927. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}